#: ../../../api/table_rows.md:1
msgid "TableRows"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/table_rows.md:3
msgid ""
"The collection belongs to a [Table](table.md). Use [TableRow](table_row.md) "
"to delete an indexed row."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/table_rows.md:1
msgid ""
"Collection of data rows in a table. Row indexes are one-based; square-"
"bracket lookup is zero-based. In xlwings Lite, `len(rows)` uses loaded "
"metadata; use `await rows.get_count()` for the current count."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../xlwings/main.py:docstring of xlwings.main.TableRows:7
msgid "Examples"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/table_rows.md:1
msgid "Add one row before one-based `index`, or append when it is `None`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/table_rows.md:3
msgid ""
"`values` must contain exactly one value per table column. Omit it to let "
"Excel create a blank row and fill calculated columns. Excel may shift cells "
"below the table downward."
msgstr ""

